WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.441
You copy something on your computer.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.334
But you need it on your phone.

3
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.385
So you send it to yourself. Again.

4
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:13.165
And your clipboard only remembers one thing. Copy again, and the last one is gone.

5
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.528
This is PasteHive. Copy here. Paste there.

6
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:24.969
It keeps everything you copy. Push the pointer to the top of the screen, search, and pick. It's pasted right where you were typing.

7
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:36.045
Copy on one device, paste on another. Text and pictures travel straight between your devices, on the same network. Encrypted, with no cloud.

8
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:41.284
Pair once, with a six-digit code. No key to type, no account to create.

9
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:47.918
PasteHive. Free and open source, for Windows, macOS and Android.
